{
  "_comment": [
    "Entry points loaded online at image build time to fill Arelle's web cache (service/warm_cache.py).",
    "Arelle follows each entry point's full DTS, so every schema and linkbase it references is cached too.",
    "The image then runs Arelle with --internetConnectivity offline against that cache.",
    "Regime entries are generated from the official taxonomy packages with service/entrypoints_from_package.py.",
    "'registries' holds XBRL International registry files that validation loads at run time, independent of regime.",
    "Changing this file changes the image contents: re-run service/warm_cache.py with --update-lock and commit service/taxonomy-cache.lock.json and a bumped service/VERSION in the same commit.",
    "esef-2024: the ESMA package declares 'esef_cor-gen-gaxml' (missing dot); corrected to esef_cor-gen-ga.xml by hand. Re-apply if the regime is regenerated.",
    "nl-inline-2025: the RJ 2025 package declares rjk-all.xsd and rj-common-practice-all.xsd, but neither file exists in the package or online (404, checked 23 November 2026); removed by hand. Re-apply if the regime is regenerated."
  ],
